{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21418","headline":"酬李六醉後见寄口号 · 元稹","name":"酬李六醉後见寄口号","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顿愈头风疾，因吟口号诗。\n文章纷似绣，珠玉布如棊。\n健羡觥飞酒，苍黄日映篱。\n命童寒色倦，抚穉晚啼饥。\n潦倒慙相识，平生颇自奇。\n明公将有问，林下是灵龟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}